{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-ayana-gardens","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"ayana-gardens-evolutions-meydan","about":"Ayana Gardens at Meydan Dubai by Tuscany Real Estate Development offers a peaceful lifestyle with studios, 1 and 2-bedroom apartments, and luxurious penthouses. Tuscany Real Estate Development and Evolutions collaborated to develop this low-rise structure, with four residential floors and a rooftop.Inspired by the Arabic term for \"wildflower,\" Ayana Gardens celebrates nature, blending luxury with lush greenery. With only 68 exclusive residences, this unique enclave combines elegance, comfort, and functional layouts for refined living. The meticulously designed master plan of Ayana Gardens harmonizes sleek architecture with verdant landscapes, providing a serene escape from the urban rush.Residents enjoy premium amenities, from a sparkling swimming pool and sun deck to landscaped gardens perfect for leisure strolls or picnics. A state-of-the-art indoor gym supports wellness routines, enhancing the Ayana Gardens lifestyle. This development creates a harmonious setting where nature, luxury, and tranquility converge, offering a balanced and peaceful living experience at Meydan.","price":831000,"title":"Ayana Gardens","bitrix":{"id":981,"pf_id":"are.2.13888","source":null,"project_id":"Ayana Gardens","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Ayana Gardens","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Evolutions","project_location":"Meydan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1657/images/2024/09/04/340x252/xXrEF6PvPL5ef7A34aWGtWrQApdE4XR5OeFJ2KSp.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1657/images/2024/09/04/464x312/xXrEF6PvPL5ef7A34aWGtWrQApdE4XR5OeFJ2KSp.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.167014,"lng":55.308849},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.n